$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Ethyl mercaptoacetate (5.65 mL, 50 mmol) was added to a mixture of the
aldehyde from above and K2CO3 (11 g, 80 mmol) in DMF (150 mL). The
resulting mixture was stirred at room temperature for 72 h, water (500
mL) was added, and the mixture was extracted with EtOAc. The organic
layer was washed with water and brine, dried with anhydrous MgSO4, and
concentrated in vacuo and the residue was chromatographed (silica gel,
3:1 hexanes-EtOAc) to provide ethyl
6-(2-quinolylmethoxy)benzo[2,3-b]thiophene-2-carboxylate (127). Yield 14
g (80%).
