$DATUM 4-fluorophenyl-3'-methoxyphenylsulfide 3-Bromoanisole (2.4 mL, 18.77
mmol, 1.0 equiv), 2-propanol (22 mL), potassium hydroxide (2.44 g, 37.54
mmol, 2.0 equiv), tetrakis (triphenylphosphine)palladium(0) (217 mg,
0.188 mmol, 0.01 equiv), (S)-BINAP (234 mg., 0.375 mmol, 0.02 equiv) and
4- flurobenezethiol (2.0 mL, 18.77 mmol, 1.0 equiv) were heated under a
nitrogen atmosphere for 4 h at 83 °C. After the reaction was completed it
was cooled (<30 °C) and quenched with water (22 mL) which resulted in
formation of an oil and allowed to granulate for 1 hr at 10-15 °C.
Separated the oil and purified by a silica gel column using 1:3 ethyl
acetate/hexane. Obtained a yellow oil12, 3.50 g.
4-fluorophenyl-3'-methoxyphenylsulfide, Yield 80% m/z 234; C13H11FOS
requires: C, 66.6; H, 4.73; S, 13.4. Found: C, 67.1; H, 4.60; S, 13.4%;
1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO- d6) δ 7.45 (m, 2H), 7.22 (m, 2H), 7.01 (m, 2H),
6.80 (m, 2H), 3.79 (s, 3H); IR (cm-1) νmax; 1590, 1576, 1489, 1479.
